                      %mi ϕ
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ‖
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} m_i {\|\phi\|} = {\|\Diamond_i\phi\|}
              \.
          %p
            As we assumed that
            %math#mathml_ebb3fc64f7a6839b45ae0069647fc37fb84ecc20_33.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Λ
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Lambda
            was normal, the normality schemata:
          %p
            %math#mathml_ebb3fc64f7a6839b45ae0069647fc37fb84ecc20_34.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
              %semantics
